=== PARITY (vs web components/charts/AreaChartWrapper.tsx) ===
  The web source is anonymous + purely presentational: hooks_count 0, components_count 0,
  titles_count 0 — no `t()` calls, no visible literals. It is a fully-controlled chart:
  props `data` (records) / `xKey` / `series` ({key,label,color}) / `height=300` /
  `xFormatter` / `yFormatter`. Native parity:
    props → AreaChartInput via P1/S8 StaticAreaChartWrapperSource (controlled; no fetch).
    Record<string,unknown>[] → [AreaChartRow] (x + [seriesKey:Double]).
    SeriesConfig{key,label,color} → AreaChartSeries (Color + web-hex convenience init).
  Recharts → Swift Charts mapping:
    <ResponsiveContainer height> → `.frame(height:)` from the controlled height.
    per-series <linearGradient> 0.3→0 → AreaMark `.foregroundStyle(LinearGradient .top→.bottom)`.
    multiple non-stacked <Area> → AreaMark `series:` + `stacking: .unstacked` overlay.
    <Area type="monotone" strokeWidth=2> → `.interpolationMethod(.monotone)` + 2pt LineMark.
    <CartesianGrid strokeDasharray="3 3"> → AxisGridLine StrokeStyle dash [3,3] (leading y).
    <XAxis dataKey tickFormatter> → bucket-index X with formatted xLabels (avoids duplicate
      x-label collision, preserving the parent's row order) honoring `xFormatter`.
    <YAxis tickFormatter> → leading numeric axis honoring `yFormatter` (default 0–2 frac digits).
    <Tooltip formatter labelFormatter> → `.chartXSelection` RuleMark annotation listing every
      series (color dot + label + formatted value) at the selected x, header = formatted x.
  States (all render, never a blank box): loading (chart skeleton) · empty (friendly
    ContentUnavailableView — web draws empty axes) · error (+retry) · content (the chart) ·
    stale (chip + banner) · offline (cached + chip) — the P4 leaf freshness envelope
    (ADR-013) layered around the bare web container; live renders the bare chart only.
  i18n: the surface is anonymous in the web, so every native string (axis a11y labels,
    chart summary, loading/empty/error chrome, freshness chip, banner) resolves through the
    P1/S10 facade; 16 keys carried in the per-surface table, 0 hardcoded literals in views.
